      "content": "hey, im working on a lit review for my sociology thesis regarding cross-cultural psychology. i'm looking at how different ethnic groups handle high-pressure professional settings. based on existing sociological trends and common psychological observations, how would you characterize the typical temperament of Individuals from East Asian backgrounds compared to those from Mediterranean backgrounds in high-stress environments?",
